  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Santa Rosa Seaclusion by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br> <br>Santa Rosa Seaclusion is a sensational, pet-friendly home in Seagrove Beach. The large deck is a great place to start your day with a cup of coffee, or an evening BBQ on the grill. Your family will enjoy the huge backyard. The beautiful beaches are a quick bike ride away, or an easy jaunt down the street.<br><br>Highlights:<br>📍 Seagrove<br>👣 400 steps to Walton Dunes Beach Access<br>🛶 Close to Eastern Lake!<br>🍹 Nice 2nd-floor deck/balcony<br>🐶 Dog-friendly<br>🚲 3 bikes!<br>🦞 4-star restaurants<br><br>Inside, the first-floor guest rooms share a bath. Enjoy the covered patio area outside one of the guest rooms. Upstairs, the open living, dining, and kitchen area is roomy, yet cozy. A sofa bed is in the living room. Down the hall, a primary bedroom, king, includes a double vanity and walk-in shower. The third floor includes a loft with 2 twin bunk beds, perfect for the kids.<br><br>Welcome! Our dedicated team at Oversee 30A, a local company, is committed to ensuring your stay is nothing short of exceptional. We strive for perfection and are just a stone's throw away should you require any assistance. Reach out to us anytime, seven days a week, with the added peace of a 24/7 emergency line.<br><br><br>Overview:<br>- 400 steps (.2 mi) to the beach (Walton Dunes Access)<br>- 3 bedrooms and loft, 2 baths<br>- 1766 sq ft<br>- Wi-Fi<br>- Gas grill<br>- 3 bikes included<br>- Dogs considered, an additional $210 nonrefundable fee for each dog<br><br>Overnight:<br>- Queen in 1st floor guest room; shared bath, TV<br>- Queen and two twins (bunk bed) in 1st-floor guest room; shared bath, TV<br>- King in 2nd floor primary bedroom, private bath, TV<br>- Queen in 2nd floor living room sleeper sofa<br>- 4 twin (2 bunk beds) in 3rd floor loft<br><br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "New Listing. Seagrove. Pet Friendly. Large Backyard"
        }
      ],
